  Description: "COMPANION / UNCOMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nFruit Basket companions
    gain 8% attack speed per Applehead talent, up to 24%. Does not affect the hero.
    Stacks by talent bodies/memories, not star level.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nChampion
    / Armor: +0.025\nChampion / Movement speed: -0.5%\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4;
    merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nEvery 4s,
    chill enemies within 2.5 units: 1.5s normally, 0.6s on bosses.\r\n\nNamed talents
    count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied
    by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately
    at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: hearth, fruit. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; three
    equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
